    {
      "id": "te773348484242",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 2260,
      "width": 1121.8,
      "height": 13.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#767a85",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 909206255,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 188137223,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790150400000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b6r",
      "text": "Design document, not screenshots: screens are drawn in the app's iOS idiom, and alerts as the apps draw them. Tags compare with phase 2 (simplex-names-flow-phase2.svg): as phase 2, changed, new.",
      "originalText": "Design document, not screenshots: screens are drawn in the app's iOS idiom, and alerts as the apps draw them. Tags compare with phase 2 (simplex-names-flow-phase2.svg): as phase 2, changed, new.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "te531133686807",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 2275,
      "width": 1225.67,
      "height": 13.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#767a85",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1876145541,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 166700938,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790150400000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b6s",
      "text": "The key is the device wallet of the wallet-keys RFC (simplex-chat#7475): one BIP-39 master per device, 24 words, no passphrase, one account per name. Phase 2 drew 12 or 24 words and a picker of several keys; both go.",
      "originalText": "The key is the device wallet of the wallet-keys RFC (simplex-chat#7475): one BIP-39 master per device, 24 words, no passphrase, one account per name. Phase 2 drew 12 or 24 words and a picker of several keys; both go.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "te889258929370",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 2290,
      "width": 539.39,
      "height": 13.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#767a85",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1877565613,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1921767917,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790150400000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b6t",
      "text": "Not drawn: a name managed elsewhere, as phase 2; exporting one name's key; deleting the key.",
      "originalText": "Not drawn: a name managed elsewhere, as phase 2; exporting one name's key; deleting the key.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
